stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR

    [*] --> Idle
    Idle: idle
    Idle: EMPTY and no amount
    InvoiceOut: 5 dollars INVOICE TAP
    InvoiceIn: 5 dollars INVOICE DOCK
    ProofOut: 5 dollars PROOF TAP
    ProofIn: 5 dollars PROOF DOCK
    Error: error
    Error: session cleared and operator informed

    Idle --> InvoiceOut: Dock B Receive USDT stages invoice
    InvoiceOut --> Idle: successful tap send
    Idle --> InvoiceIn: one-shot tap receives invoice
    InvoiceIn --> Idle: Dock A Send USDT reads invoice
    Idle --> ProofOut: confirmed send stages consignment
    ProofOut --> Idle: successful tap send
    Idle --> ProofIn: one-shot tap receives consignment
    ProofIn --> Idle: Dock B Receive USDT reads proof
    InvoiceOut --> Error: transfer failure keeps artifact
    InvoiceIn --> Error: dock read failure keeps artifact
    ProofOut --> Error: transfer failure keeps artifact
    ProofIn --> Error: import failure persists dock copy
    Error --> Idle: explicit recovery completes

    note right of ProofOut
        Human confirmation occurs on Dock A before broadcast.
        Ambiguous sends are audited and never retried automatically.
    end note
